    "id": "proceso",
    "titulo": "Proceso",
    "html": "<section style=\"background:#F7EFE4;color:#3D201D;font-family:Figtree, Arial, sans-serif\"><p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:128px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-family:Figtree, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;color:inherit\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:99px;background:#D8EC83;display:inline-block\"></span>07 · Proceso y medición</p><h2 style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:190px;width:1500px;font-family:Newsreader, Georgia, serif;font-weight:300;font-size:80px;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-1.5px;color:inherit\">De la idea <i>a la publicación</i>.</h2><div style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:420px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:99px;background:#3D201D;color:#F7EFE4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">1</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:182px;top:441px;width:173px;height:2px;background:#DCC6B5\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:490px;width:217px;font-family:Newsreader, Georgia, serif;font-weight:300;font-size:32px;line-height:1.08\">Planificación</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:580px;width:211px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.42;font-weight:400;color:#76594F;\">Calendario del mes con pilar, formato y fecha de cada pieza.</p><div style=\"position:absolute;left:365px;top:420px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:99px;background:#3D201D;color:#F7EFE4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">2</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:419px;top:441px;width:173px;height:2px;background:#DCC6B5\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:365px;top:490px;width:217px;font-family:Newsreader, Georgia, serif;font-weight:300;font-size:32px;line-height:1.08\">Validación</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:365px;top:580px;width:211px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.42;font-weight:400;color:#76594F;\">All About Management y la clínica aprueban el calendario.</p><div style=\"position:absolute;left:602px;top:420px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:99px;background:#3D201D;color:#F7EFE4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">3</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:656px;top:441px;width:173px;height:2px;background:#DCC6B5\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:602px;top:490px;width:217px;font-family:Newsreader, Georgia, serif;font-weight:300;font-size:32px;line-height:1.08\">Rodaje</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:602px;top:580px;width:211px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.42;font-weight:400;color:#76594F;\">En la clínica, con guiones cerrados.</p><div style=\"position:absolute;left:839px;top:420px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:99px;background:#3D201D;color:#F7EFE4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">4</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:893px;top:441px;width:173px;height:2px;background:#DCC6B5\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:839px;top:490px;width:217px;font-family:Newsreader, Georgia, serif;font-weight:300;font-size:32px;line-height:1.08\">Edición y diseño</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:839px;top:580px;width:211px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.42;font-weight:400;color:#76594F;\">Reels, carruseles y copys con el sistema visual.</p><div style=\"position:absolute;left:1076px;top:420px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:99px;background:#3D201D;color:#F7EFE4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">5</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:1130px;top:441px;width:173px;height:2px;background:#DCC6B5\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:1076px;top:490px;width:217px;font-family:Newsreader, Georgia, serif;font-weight:300;font-size:32px;line-height:1.08\">Revisión</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:1076px;top:580px;width:211px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.42;font-weight:400;color:#76594F;\">Validación médica de los textos y visto bueno final.</p><div style=\"position:absolute;left:1313px;top:420px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:99px;background:#3D201D;color:#F7EFE4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">6</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:1367px;top:441px;width:173px;height:2px;background:#DCC6B5\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:1313px;top:490px;width:217px;font-family:Newsreader, Georgia, serif;font-weight:300;font-size:32px;line-height:1.08\">Publicación</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:1313px;top:580px;width:211px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.42;font-weight:400;color:#76594F;\">Instagram y TikTok, y respuesta a comentarios.</p><div style=\"position:absolute;left:1550px;top:420px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:99px;background:#D8EC83;color:#3D201D;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">7</div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:1550px;top:490px;width:217px;font-family:Newsreader, Georgia, serif;font-weight:300;font-size:32px;line-height:1.08\">Informe</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:1550px;top:580px;width:211px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.42;font-weight:400;color:#76594F;\">Resultados del mes y ajustes para el siguiente.</p><div style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:780px;width:1664px;height:160px;border-radius:22px;background:#EDE1D5;\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:168px;top:816px;width:1580px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.42;font-weight:400;color:inherit;\"><b>Cada mes:</b> el calendario se presenta antes de empezar el mes, el material se envía para validar con antelación a su publicación y el informe se comparte al cerrar el mes. Las fechas exactas las fijamos juntos.</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;right:128px;bottom:52px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#76594F\"><span>All About Management × Skin Laundry · Briefing de contenido</span><span>69</span></p></section>"
